Solver: COPT (coptpy)
- Import: `import coptpy as cp` and `from coptpy import COPT`
- Create environment: `env = cp.Envr()`
- Create model: `model = env.createModel("problem")`
- Variable types: `COPT.CONTINUOUS`, `COPT.INTEGER`, `COPT.BINARY`
- Add constraint: `model.addConstr(...)`
- Set objective: `model.setObjective(..., sense=COPT.MINIMIZE)` or `COPT.MAXIMIZE`
- Solve: `model.solve()`
- Check status: `model.status == COPT.OPTIMAL`
- Get objective value: `model.objval`
